 Updating to WoF versin 3.9

 If you are updating from an earlier version of Wof (for BBBBS)
 just copy the file "Wheel_of_Fortune.rexx" over the old one.
 Also copy the file "WoF.puzzles" into your Rexxdoors/Data Dir.
 This version uses the same data files as the previous version.
 This way, you wont have to change any of your users stats.

 To see what's new, read the WoFdoc file.

           6-19-92 Matt English